    Bug 1950086 - Attempt to fix intermittent by waiting for messages to show up in the folder. r=freaktechnik,mkmelin

    The screenshot from the fail [1] shows that the some folders do not
    contain all the messages they should contain. This could also be the
    cause for bug 1933699.

    This fix is waiting until the number of expected messages are seen in
    the folder.

    [1] : https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try-comm-central&selectedTaskRun=a6JOOZN1Rh2zSPQVQTg_Fg.0

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D239329

